window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b235-3d307c3ddd9df05c.json"]={sha256:"3d307c3ddd9df05cf2fcb8919d3899998d8ec11f710631f9ab6d13fda45d8b1c",value:{"id":"b235","title":"心牆土石壩分區填築","titleEn":"Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課以心牆土石壩分區填築為入口，深入心牆阻水、反濾排水與分區填築的相容。十個單元各自對應不同的荷載路徑、能量交換或監測問題，從守恆式建立量化估算，再檢查量測配置是否能辨認真正失效原因。工程史實只採用列明範圍的公開一手資料；所有模型輸入另標為教學假設，成果是可追溯的工程判讀紀錄。","summaryEn":"Using Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams as its entry point, this course examines compatibility of core sealing, filter drainage and zoned embankment placement. Ten units address different load paths, energy exchanges or monitoring questions, starting with conservation-based estimates and testing whether observations distinguish failure causes. Historical statements use scoped primary evidence. Numerical model inputs are separately identified as teaching assumptions, producing a traceable engineering interpretation record.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-systems","subcategoryTitle":"防潮、航運與大壩施工","subcategoryTitleEn":"Tidal barriers, navigation and dam construction","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-systems","learningTags":["water","water-systems","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-dam","architectureNodes":[["分區滲透功能","Hydraulic functions of zones"],["密度孔隙與飽和度","Density void ratio and saturation"],["心牆拱效應與沉降差","Core arching and differential settlement"],["排水帶流量與水頭","Drain flow and hydraulic head"],["快速退水與支承改變","Rapid drawdown and lost support"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-dam","labels":["分區滲透功能","密度孔隙與飽和度","心牆拱效應與沉降差","排水帶流量與水頭","快速退水與支承改變"],"labelsEn":["Hydraulic functions of zones","Density void ratio and saturation","Core arching and differential settlement","Drain flow and hydraulic head","Rapid drawdown and lost support"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"本課原創比較練習分兩個相互獨立的物理模型。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。先逐一圈出公式內的控制體、力方向或時間尺度，再把每項輸入的量綱換成一致單位。第二人只根據輸入重算結果，不抄第一人的中間數字。最後指出這兩個估算尚未包含的空間變化、非線性及量測誤差；若將結果用於另一座工程，必須重建其幾何、材料與邊界條件，不能挪用本練習的假設。 達西敏感度固定平均水力坡降5與通流面積1000 m²，只將k由10⁻⁹增至2×10⁻⁹ m/s。Q=kiA由5×10⁻⁶增至10⁻⁵ m³/s，即0.005增至0.010 L/s，恰為兩倍。這要求同一均質、無裂縫材料內仍可用線性達西流；若提高流量是裂縫或繞流造成，就不能只用調整均質k來解釋。","textEn":"This original comparison exercise uses two independent physical models. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m². Darcy Q=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s, for homogeneous uncracked material. Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent. Added water is forty tonnes, excluding evaporation and mixing losses and not a field recipe. First identify the control volume, force direction or time scale in each relation, then convert every input to consistent units. A second reviewer recalculates from the inputs without copying intermediate numbers. Finally identify spatial variability, nonlinear effects and measurement errors omitted by both estimates. Transfer to another structure requires rebuilding its geometry, material description and boundary conditions; the assumed classroom inputs are not transferable design or operating parameters. For Darcy sensitivity, hold gradient five and flow area 1000 m² fixed, changing only k from 10⁻⁹ to 2×10⁻⁹ m/s. Q=kiA doubles from 5×10⁻⁶ to 10⁻⁵ m³/s, or 0.005 to 0.010 L/s. This assumes linear Darcy flow in the same homogeneous uncracked medium; increased flow from cracking or bypass cannot be explained solely by adjusting homogeneous k.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b235-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「分區滲透功能」與「含水調整與乾土質量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Hydraulic functions of zones\" and \"Moisture adjustment on dry mass\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b235-v15-01","title":"分區滲透功能：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Hydraulic functions of zones: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「分區滲透功能」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hydraulic functions of zones” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"心牆降低滲流，反濾層保持細土，排水層把水安全導出；三者功能不同。把所有區域都做得不透水，可能反而讓下游孔壓無法消散。 假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。 小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。若排水層被細料污染，孔壓會增加而不是變得更安全，必須依各區功能解讀性能。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「分區滲透功能」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The core limits flow, filters retain fines and drains safely release water. Their functions differ, and making every zone impermeable can prevent downstream pore pressures from dissipating. Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m². Darcy Q=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s, for homogeneous uncracked material. A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability. Fines-contaminated drains can raise pressure rather than improve safety, requiring performance to be interpreted according to each zones intended function. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hydraulic functions of zones” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m².","failure":"常見誤解：「所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「分區滲透功能」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hydraulic functions of zones”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-01-k1","title":"分區滲透功能","titleEn":"Hydraulic functions of zones","text":"心牆降低滲流，反濾層保持細土，排水層把水安全導出；三者功能不同。把所有區域都做得不透水，可能反而讓下游孔壓無法消散。","textEn":"The core limits flow, filters retain fines and drains safely release water. Their functions differ, and making every zone impermeable can prevent downstream pore pressures from dissipating.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「分區滲透功能」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hydraulic functions of zones\" is correct?","options":["所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。","心牆降低滲流，反濾層保持細土，排水層把水安全導出；三者功能不同。","用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。"],"optionsEn":["Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer.","The core limits flow, filters retain fines and drains safely release water.","Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition."],"answer":1,"explanation":"心牆降低滲流，反濾層保持細土，排水層把水安全導出；三者功能不同。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The core limits flow, filters retain fines and drains safely release water. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b235-v15-02","title":"分區滲透功能：定量估算","titleEn":"Hydraulic functions of zones: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「分區滲透功能」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hydraulic functions of zones” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m². Darcy Q=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s, for homogeneous uncracked material. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m². Darcy Q=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s, for homogeneous uncracked material.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「分區滲透功能」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hydraulic functions of zones\", which statement holds?","options":["只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。","反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s。"],"optionsEn":["Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress.","A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設心牆k=10⁻⁹ m/s、平均水力坡降5、通流面積1000 m²，達西Q=kiA=5×10⁻⁶ m³/s=0.005 L/s；均質無裂縫。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core k=10⁻⁹ m/s, gradient five and flow area 1000 m². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b235-v15-03","title":"分區滲透功能：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Hydraulic functions of zones: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「分區滲透功能」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydraulic functions of zones” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。分別列出完整心牆流與缺陷集中流的證據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Compare pressure contours and discharge, using crack scenarios to identify paths omitted by the intact-soil Darcy estimate. List intact-core flow evidence separately from concentrated flow through defects. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以分區滲透功能編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic functions of zones, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Compare pressure contours and discharge, using crack scenarios to identify paths omitted by the intact-soil Darcy estimate.","failure":"注意干擾：小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。分別列出完整心牆流與缺陷集中流的證據。","textEn":"Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Compare pressure contours and discharge, using crack scenarios to identify paths omitted by the intact-soil Darcy estimate. List intact-core flow evidence separately from concentrated flow through defects.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以分區滲透功能編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic functions of zones, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Compare pressure contours and discharge, using crack scenarios to identify paths omitted by the intact-soil Darcy estimate.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「分區滲透功能」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hydraulic functions of zones\"?","options":["將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。"],"optionsEn":["Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將心牆、反濾和排水的粒徑與滲透資料分區保存，核對模型控制體；比較孔壓等值線和排水量，並用裂縫情境檢查完整土體達西估算會漏掉哪些流路。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Keep core, filter and drain grading and permeability separately and verify model control volumes. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b235-v15-04","title":"分區滲透功能：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hydraulic functions of zones: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「分區滲透功能」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydraulic functions of zones” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。若排水層被細料污染，孔壓會增加而不是變得更安全，必須依各區功能解讀性能。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability. Fines-contaminated drains can raise pressure rather than improve safety, requiring performance to be interpreted according to each zones intended function. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若排水層被細料污染，孔壓會增加而不是變得更安全，必須依各區功能解讀性能。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Fines-contaminated drains can raise pressure rather than improve safety, requiring performance to be interpreted according to each zones intended function.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。若排水層被細料污染，孔壓會增加而不是變得更安全，必須依各區功能解讀性能。","textEn":"A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability. Fines-contaminated drains can raise pressure rather than improve safety, requiring performance to be interpreted according to each zones intended function.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「分區滲透功能」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hydraulic functions of zones\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。","用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability.","Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition."],"answer":1,"explanation":"小範圍裂縫可能主導總流量，即使心牆材料滲透率很低。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A small crack can dominate flow despite low intact-core permeability. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b235-v15-05","title":"含水調整與乾土質量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Moisture adjustment on dry mass: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「含水調整與乾土質量」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Moisture adjustment on dry mass” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"心牆含水量以水重除乾土重定義，施工加水須先區分乾土與濕土基準。含水量影響壓實、滲透和施工孔壓，不能只追求最大乾密度。 假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。 表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。材料濕側施工也可能提高短期孔壓，需與穩定需求共同評估。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「含水調整與乾土質量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Core water content is water mass divided by dry-soil mass, so water addition requires a clear dry versus wet basis. Moisture affects compaction, permeability and construction pore pressure rather than density alone. Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent. Added water is forty tonnes, excluding evaporation and mixing losses and not a field recipe. Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean. Using wet mass miscalculates additions, and wetter placement can raise short-term pore pressure, requiring evaluation with stability needs. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Moisture adjustment on dry mass” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent.","failure":"常見誤解：「用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「含水調整與乾土質量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Moisture adjustment on dry mass”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-05-k1","title":"含水調整與乾土質量","titleEn":"Moisture adjustment on dry mass","text":"心牆含水量以水重除乾土重定義，施工加水須先區分乾土與濕土基準。含水量影響壓實、滲透和施工孔壓，不能只追求最大乾密度。","textEn":"Core water content is water mass divided by dry-soil mass, so water addition requires a clear dry versus wet basis. Moisture affects compaction, permeability and construction pore pressure rather than density alone.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「含水調整與乾土質量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Moisture adjustment on dry mass\" is correct?","options":["用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。","乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。","心牆含水量以水重除乾土重定義，施工加水須先區分乾土與濕土基準。"],"optionsEn":["Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition.","Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.","Core water content is water mass divided by dry-soil mass, so water addition requires a clear dry versus wet basis."],"answer":2,"explanation":"心牆含水量以水重除乾土重定義，施工加水須先區分乾土與濕土基準。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Core water content is water mass divided by dry-soil mass, so water addition requires a clear dry versus wet basis. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b235-v15-06","title":"含水調整與乾土質量：定量估算","titleEn":"Moisture adjustment on dry mass: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「含水調整與乾土質量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Moisture adjustment on dry mass” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent. Added water is forty tonnes, excluding evaporation and mixing losses and not a field recipe. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent. Added water is forty tonnes, excluding evaporation and mixing losses and not a field recipe.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「含水調整與乾土質量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Moisture adjustment on dry mass\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t。","心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。","排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent.","Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance.","High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設乾土1000 t、初始含水率12%、目標16%，需加水(0.16−0.12)×1000=40 t；未含蒸發和混合損失，不是工地配方。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume dry soil 1000 t, initial water content twelve percent and target sixteen percent. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b235-v15-07","title":"含水調整與乾土質量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Moisture adjustment on dry mass: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「含水調整與乾土質量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Moisture adjustment on dry mass” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。在壓實層底重新取樣檢查上濕下乾現象。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone. Resample the compacted lift bottom to check for a wet-top dry-bottom profile. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以含水調整與乾土質量編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for moisture adjustment on dry mass, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone.","failure":"注意干擾：表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。在壓實層底重新取樣檢查上濕下乾現象。","textEn":"Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone. Resample the compacted lift bottom to check for a wet-top dry-bottom profile.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以含水調整與乾土質量編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for moisture adjustment on dry mass, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Close added water against weather losses and compare post-compaction pore pressure, strength and permeability rather than mean moisture alone.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「含水調整與乾土質量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Moisture adjustment on dry mass\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。","新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity.","All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先由烘乾試驗核對乾土質量，再對不同深度取樣檢查混合均勻；將加水計量與天候損失閉合，並比較壓實後孔壓、強度和滲透試驗而非只有含水平均。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Verify dry mass by drying tests and sample several depths for mixing uniformity. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b235-v15-08","title":"含水調整與乾土質量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Moisture adjustment on dry mass: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「含水調整與乾土質量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Moisture adjustment on dry mass” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。材料濕側施工也可能提高短期孔壓，需與穩定需求共同評估。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean. Using wet mass miscalculates additions, and wetter placement can raise short-term pore pressure, requiring evaluation with stability needs. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：材料濕側施工也可能提高短期孔壓，需與穩定需求共同評估。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Using wet mass miscalculates additions, and wetter placement can raise short-term pore pressure, requiring evaluation with stability needs.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。材料濕側施工也可能提高短期孔壓，需與穩定需求共同評估。","textEn":"Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean. Using wet mass miscalculates additions, and wetter placement can raise short-term pore pressure, requiring evaluation with stability needs.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「含水調整與乾土質量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Moisture adjustment on dry mass\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。","表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.","Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean."],"answer":2,"explanation":"表面灑水可能使上濕下乾，平均含水正確仍有弱層；誤用濕土重量會算錯補水量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Surface wetting can leave wet tops and dry bottoms despite a correct mean. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b235-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「密度孔隙與飽和度」與「水力劈裂與小主應力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Density void ratio and saturation\" and \"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b235-v15-09","title":"密度孔隙與飽和度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Density void ratio and saturation: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「密度孔隙與飽和度」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Density void ratio and saturation” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"乾密度與顆粒比重決定孔隙比，再結合含水量可估飽和度。這些相態關係能抓出不合理數據，但不能取代強度與滲透試驗。 此處水密度為1000 kg/m³。假設Gs=2.7、ρd=1800 kg/m³、ρw=1000，e=Gsρw/ρd−1=0.5；含水率0.15時Sr=wGs/e=0.81。 相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。若比重取自不同土源，飽和度估算也會產生系統性偏差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「密度孔隙與飽和度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Dry density and particle specific gravity determine void ratio, which combines with water content to estimate saturation. Phase relations detect inconsistent data without replacing strength or permeability testing. Water density here is 1000 kg/m³. Assume Gs=2.7, dry density 1800 kg/m³ and water density 1000. Void ratio is 0.5; at water content 0.15, saturation Sr=wGs/e=0.81. Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids. Specific gravity from a different borrow source also creates systematic error in inferred saturation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Density void ratio and saturation” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：此處水密度為1000 kg/m³。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Water density here is 1000 kg/m³.","failure":"常見誤解：「乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「密度孔隙與飽和度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Density void ratio and saturation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-09-k1","title":"密度孔隙與飽和度","titleEn":"Density void ratio and saturation","text":"乾密度與顆粒比重決定孔隙比，再結合含水量可估飽和度。這些相態關係能抓出不合理數據，但不能取代強度與滲透試驗。","textEn":"Dry density and particle specific gravity determine void ratio, which combines with water content to estimate saturation. Phase relations detect inconsistent data without replacing strength or permeability testing.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「密度孔隙與飽和度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Density void ratio and saturation\" is correct?","options":["乾密度與顆粒比重決定孔隙比，再結合含水量可估飽和度。","乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。","只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["Dry density and particle specific gravity determine void ratio, which combines with water content to estimate saturation.","Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.","Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress."],"answer":0,"explanation":"乾密度與顆粒比重決定孔隙比，再結合含水量可估飽和度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Dry density and particle specific gravity determine void ratio, which combines with water content to estimate saturation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b235-v15-10","title":"密度孔隙與飽和度：定量估算","titleEn":"Density void ratio and saturation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「密度孔隙與飽和度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Density void ratio and saturation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：此處水密度為1000 kg/m³。假設Gs=2.7、ρd=1800 kg/m³、ρw=1000，e=Gsρw/ρd−1=0.5；含水率0.15時Sr=wGs/e=0.81。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Water density here is 1000 kg/m³. Assume Gs=2.7, dry density 1800 kg/m³ and water density 1000. Void ratio is 0.5; at water content 0.15, saturation Sr=wGs/e=0.81. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：此處水密度為1000 kg/m³。假設Gs=2.7、ρd=1800 kg/m³、ρw=1000，e=Gsρw/ρd−1=0.5；含水率0.15時Sr=wGs/e=0.81。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Water density here is 1000 kg/m³. Assume Gs=2.7, dry density 1800 kg/m³ and water density 1000. Void ratio is 0.5; at water content 0.15, saturation Sr=wGs/e=0.81.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「密度孔隙與飽和度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Density void ratio and saturation\", which statement holds?","options":["反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：此處水密度為1000 kg/m³。","各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。"],"optionsEn":["A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Water density here is 1000 kg/m³.","Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：此處水密度為1000 kg/m³。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Water density here is 1000 kg/m³. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b235-v15-11","title":"密度孔隙與飽和度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Density void ratio and saturation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「密度孔隙與飽和度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Density void ratio and saturation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。以體積和質量閉合檢查取樣體積是否失真。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Investigate units, coarse-particle corrections and sample volume before interpreting spatial variation. Use volume-mass closure to check whether the sampling volume is distorted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以密度孔隙與飽和度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for density void ratio and saturation, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Investigate units, coarse-particle corrections and sample volume before interpreting spatial variation.","failure":"注意干擾：相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。以體積和質量閉合檢查取樣體積是否失真。","textEn":"Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Investigate units, coarse-particle corrections and sample volume before interpreting spatial variation. Use volume-mass closure to check whether the sampling volume is distorted.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以密度孔隙與飽和度編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for density void ratio and saturation, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Investigate units, coarse-particle corrections and sample volume before interpreting spatial variation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「密度孔隙與飽和度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Density void ratio and saturation\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。","同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum.","Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one."],"answer":2,"explanation":"同批樣品核對比重、乾密度和含水量，檢查計算飽和度是否介於零與一；若不合理，回查單位、粗粒修正和取樣體積，再評估不同位置的變異。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check specific gravity, dry density and moisture on matched samples and ensure computed saturation lies between zero and one. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b235-v15-12","title":"密度孔隙與飽和度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Density void ratio and saturation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「密度孔隙與飽和度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Density void ratio and saturation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。若比重取自不同土源，飽和度估算也會產生系統性偏差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids. Specific gravity from a different borrow source also creates systematic error in inferred saturation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若比重取自不同土源，飽和度估算也會產生系統性偏差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Specific gravity from a different borrow source also creates systematic error in inferred saturation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。若比重取自不同土源，飽和度估算也會產生系統性偏差。","textEn":"Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids. Specific gravity from a different borrow source also creates systematic error in inferred saturation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「密度孔隙與飽和度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Density void ratio and saturation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress."],"answer":0,"explanation":"相態閉合正常仍不保證土體結構均勻，團塊間大孔隙可能與團塊內高密度共存。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Consistent phase relations do not prove uniform fabric: dense clods can coexist with large interclod voids. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b235-v15-13","title":"水力劈裂與小主應力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「水力劈裂與小主應力」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hydraulic fracture and minor stress” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"心牆若因拱效應使小主壓應力降低，蓄水壓力可能沿弱面推開土體。簡單總應力比較只能提示敏感性，實際起裂還取決於抗拉、缺陷和應力路徑。 假設局部總小主壓應力250 kPa、水壓220 kPa，差30 kPa；若拱效應降低總應力50 kPa，差變−20 kPa，僅無抗拉篩選。 以豎向覆土壓力代替最小主應力會漏掉橫向低應力區，儀器局部剛度也可能干擾讀值。只比單一水壓數字，不能確定劈裂位置或後續內部侵蝕。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水力劈裂與小主應力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Arching can reduce the core minor compressive stress, allowing reservoir pressure to open weak planes. A simple total-stress comparison indicates sensitivity; initiation also depends on tension resistance, defects and stress history. Assume local total minor compression 250 kPa and water pressure 220 kPa, leaving 30 kPa. Reducing total stress by 50 kPa gives −20 kPa, a zero-tension screening comparison only. Replacing minor principal stress with vertical overburden misses low lateral-stress zones, while instrument stiffness disturbs readings. A single pressure comparison cannot locate fracture or establish subsequent internal erosion. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hydraulic fracture and minor stress” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設局部總小主壓應力250 kPa、水壓220 kPa，差30 kPa；若拱效應降低總應力50 kPa，差變−20 kPa，僅無抗拉篩選。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume local total minor compression 250 kPa and water pressure 220 kPa, leaving 30 kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「水力劈裂與小主應力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hydraulic fracture and minor stress”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-13-k1","title":"水力劈裂與小主應力","titleEn":"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress","text":"心牆若因拱效應使小主壓應力降低，蓄水壓力可能沿弱面推開土體。簡單總應力比較只能提示敏感性，實際起裂還取決於抗拉、缺陷和應力路徑。","textEn":"Arching can reduce the core minor compressive stress, allowing reservoir pressure to open weak planes. A simple total-stress comparison indicates sensitivity; initiation also depends on tension resistance, defects and stress history.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水力劈裂與小主應力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress\" is correct?","options":["只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。","心牆若因拱效應使小主壓應力降低，蓄水壓力可能沿弱面推開土體。","心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。"],"optionsEn":["Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress.","Arching can reduce the core minor compressive stress, allowing reservoir pressure to open weak planes.","Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"心牆若因拱效應使小主壓應力降低，蓄水壓力可能沿弱面推開土體。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Arching can reduce the core minor compressive stress, allowing reservoir pressure to open weak planes. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b235-v15-14","title":"水力劈裂與小主應力：定量估算","titleEn":"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「水力劈裂與小主應力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hydraulic fracture and minor stress” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設局部總小主壓應力250 kPa、水壓220 kPa，差30 kPa；若拱效應降低總應力50 kPa，差變−20 kPa，僅無抗拉篩選。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume local total minor compression 250 kPa and water pressure 220 kPa, leaving 30 kPa. Reducing total stress by 50 kPa gives −20 kPa, a zero-tension screening comparison only. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設局部總小主壓應力250 kPa、水壓220 kPa，差30 kPa；若拱效應降低總應力50 kPa，差變−20 kPa，僅無抗拉篩選。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume local total minor compression 250 kPa and water pressure 220 kPa, leaving 30 kPa. Reducing total stress by 50 kPa gives −20 kPa, a zero-tension screening comparison only.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水力劈裂與小主應力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress\", which statement holds?","options":["排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。","新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設局部總小主壓應力250 kPa、水壓220 kPa，差30 kPa。"],"optionsEn":["High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition.","All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume local total minor compression 250 kPa and water pressure 220 kPa, leaving 30 kPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設局部總小主壓應力250 kPa、水壓220 kPa，差30 kPa；若拱效應降低總應力50 kPa，差變−20 kPa，僅無抗拉篩選。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume local total minor compression 250 kPa and water pressure 220 kPa, leaving 30 kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b235-v15-15","title":"水力劈裂與小主應力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水力劈裂與小主應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hydraulic fracture and minor stress” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。檢查最小主應力方向是否與假設裂縫面相符。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer. Compare pre- and post-filling stress paths and interpret sensitive zones using cracks, seepage and filter protection together. Check whether the minor-principal-stress direction matches the assumed fracture plane. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以水力劈裂與小主應力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic fracture and minor stress, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer. Compare pre- and post-filling stress paths and interpret sensitive zones using cracks, seepage and filter protection together.","failure":"注意干擾：以豎向覆土壓力代替最小主應力會漏掉橫向低應力區，儀器局部剛度也可能干擾讀值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Replacing minor principal stress with vertical overburden misses low lateral-stress zones, while instrument stiffness disturbs readings. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。檢查最小主應力方向是否與假設裂縫面相符。","textEn":"Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer. Compare pre- and post-filling stress paths and interpret sensitive zones using cracks, seepage and filter protection together. Check whether the minor-principal-stress direction matches the assumed fracture plane.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以水力劈裂與小主應力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for hydraulic fracture and minor stress, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer. Compare pre- and post-filling stress paths and interpret sensitive zones using cracks, seepage and filter protection together.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水力劈裂與小主應力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress\"?","options":["核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。"],"optionsEn":["Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer."],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對量測的是總應力還是有效應力，將孔壓和土壓計布置到同層位；比較蓄水前後應力路徑，並用裂縫、漏流與反濾保護證據一起判讀敏感區。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Identify total versus effective stress and colocate pressure and earth-pressure observations by layer. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b235-v15-16","title":"水力劈裂與小主應力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「水力劈裂與小主應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hydraulic fracture and minor stress” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"以豎向覆土壓力代替最小主應力會漏掉橫向低應力區，儀器局部剛度也可能干擾讀值。只比單一水壓數字，不能確定劈裂位置或後續內部侵蝕。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Replacing minor principal stress with vertical overburden misses low lateral-stress zones, while instrument stiffness disturbs readings. A single pressure comparison cannot locate fracture or establish subsequent internal erosion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：只比單一水壓數字，不能確定劈裂位置或後續內部侵蝕。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A single pressure comparison cannot locate fracture or establish subsequent internal erosion.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以豎向覆土壓力代替最小主應力會漏掉橫向低應力區，儀器局部剛度也可能干擾讀值。只比單一水壓數字，不能確定劈裂位置或後續內部侵蝕。","textEn":"Replacing minor principal stress with vertical overburden misses low lateral-stress zones, while instrument stiffness disturbs readings. A single pressure comparison cannot locate fracture or establish subsequent internal erosion.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水力劈裂與小主應力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hydraulic fracture and minor stress\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","以豎向覆土壓力代替最小主應力會漏掉橫向低應力區，儀器局部剛度也可能干擾讀值。","心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Replacing minor principal stress with vertical overburden misses low lateral-stress zones, while instrument stiffness disturbs readings.","Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以豎向覆土壓力代替最小主應力會漏掉橫向低應力區，儀器局部剛度也可能干擾讀值。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Replacing minor principal stress with vertical overburden misses low lateral-stress zones, while instrument stiffness disturbs readings. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b235-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「心牆拱效應與沉降差」與「反濾保持與排水能力」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Core arching and differential settlement\" and \"Filter retention and drainage capacity\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b235-v15-17","title":"心牆拱效應與沉降差：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Core arching and differential settlement: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「心牆拱效應與沉降差」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Core arching and differential settlement” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"較軟心牆與較硬壩殼變形不同，界面剪力可把部分豎向荷載轉移到兩側。這有時降低心牆壓應力，不能把荷載轉移一律視為有利。 假設原豎向應力600 kPa、側向界面轉移比例0.25，剩餘450 kPa；此為量化荷載分配假設，不是普遍拱效應係數。 窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。若只以心牆壓力降低當作減載好處，會忽略裂縫與水力劈裂敏感性提高。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「心牆拱效應與沉降差」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A softer core and stiffer shells settle differently, allowing interface shear to transfer vertical load sideways. Reduced core compression can be unfavorable, so load transfer is not automatically beneficial. Assume original vertical stress 600 kPa and side-interface transfer fraction 0.25. Remaining stress is 450 kPa, an assumed load split rather than a universal arching coefficient. Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient. Viewing reduced core stress only as beneficial unloading overlooks increased sensitivity to cracking and hydraulic fracture. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Core arching and differential settlement” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設原豎向應力600 kPa、側向界面轉移比例0.25，剩餘450 kPa；此為量化荷載分配假設，不是普遍拱效應係數。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume original vertical stress 600 kPa and side-interface transfer fraction 0.25.","failure":"常見誤解：「心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「心牆拱效應與沉降差」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Core arching and differential settlement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-17-k1","title":"心牆拱效應與沉降差","titleEn":"Core arching and differential settlement","text":"較軟心牆與較硬壩殼變形不同，界面剪力可把部分豎向荷載轉移到兩側。這有時降低心牆壓應力，不能把荷載轉移一律視為有利。","textEn":"A softer core and stiffer shells settle differently, allowing interface shear to transfer vertical load sideways. Reduced core compression can be unfavorable, so load transfer is not automatically beneficial.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「心牆拱效應與沉降差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Core arching and differential settlement\" is correct?","options":["心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。","反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。","較軟心牆與較硬壩殼變形不同，界面剪力可把部分豎向荷載轉移到兩側。"],"optionsEn":["Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance.","A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.","A softer core and stiffer shells settle differently, allowing interface shear to transfer vertical load sideways."],"answer":2,"explanation":"較軟心牆與較硬壩殼變形不同，界面剪力可把部分豎向荷載轉移到兩側。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A softer core and stiffer shells settle differently, allowing interface shear to transfer vertical load sideways. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b235-v15-18","title":"心牆拱效應與沉降差：定量估算","titleEn":"Core arching and differential settlement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「心牆拱效應與沉降差」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Core arching and differential settlement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設原豎向應力600 kPa、側向界面轉移比例0.25，剩餘450 kPa；此為量化荷載分配假設，不是普遍拱效應係數。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume original vertical stress 600 kPa and side-interface transfer fraction 0.25. Remaining stress is 450 kPa, an assumed load split rather than a universal arching coefficient. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設原豎向應力600 kPa、側向界面轉移比例0.25，剩餘450 kPa；此為量化荷載分配假設，不是普遍拱效應係數。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume original vertical stress 600 kPa and side-interface transfer fraction 0.25. Remaining stress is 450 kPa, an assumed load split rather than a universal arching coefficient.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「心牆拱效應與沉降差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Core arching and differential settlement\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設原豎向應力600 kPa、側向界面轉移比例0.25，剩餘450 kPa；此為量化荷載分配假設，不是普遍拱效應係數。","各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。","水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume original vertical stress 600 kPa and side-interface transfer fraction 0.25.","Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned.","At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設原豎向應力600 kPa、側向界面轉移比例0.25，剩餘450 kPa；此為量化荷載分配假設，不是普遍拱效應係數。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume original vertical stress 600 kPa and side-interface transfer fraction 0.25. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b235-v15-19","title":"心牆拱效應與沉降差：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Core arching and differential settlement: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「心牆拱效應與沉降差」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Core arching and differential settlement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。比較陡岸與谷底區域的應力轉移差異。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction. Test low-stress zones across stiffness ratios and retain the history of construction elevation differences. Compare stress-transfer behavior near steep abutments with the valley-center region. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以心牆拱效應與沉降差編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for core arching and differential settlement, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction. Test low-stress zones across stiffness ratios and retain the history of construction elevation differences.","failure":"注意干擾：窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。比較陡岸與谷底區域的應力轉移差異。","textEn":"Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction. Test low-stress zones across stiffness ratios and retain the history of construction elevation differences. Compare stress-transfer behavior near steep abutments with the valley-center region.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以心牆拱效應與沉降差編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for core arching and differential settlement, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction. Test low-stress zones across stiffness ratios and retain the history of construction elevation differences.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「心牆拱效應與沉降差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Core arching and differential settlement\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。","用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction.","Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition."],"answer":1,"explanation":"比較心牆和壩殼分層沉降、土壓與孔壓，檢查荷載是否按界面方向轉移；用不同剛度比模型測試局部低應力區，並核對施工高差的時間歷程。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare layer settlement, total stress and pore pressure in core and shells, checking interface load-transfer direction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b235-v15-20","title":"心牆拱效應與沉降差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Core arching and differential settlement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「心牆拱效應與沉降差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Core arching and differential settlement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。若只以心牆壓力降低當作減載好處，會忽略裂縫與水力劈裂敏感性提高。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient. Viewing reduced core stress only as beneficial unloading overlooks increased sensitivity to cracking and hydraulic fracture. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若只以心牆壓力降低當作減載好處，會忽略裂縫與水力劈裂敏感性提高。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Viewing reduced core stress only as beneficial unloading overlooks increased sensitivity to cracking and hydraulic fracture.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。若只以心牆壓力降低當作減載好處，會忽略裂縫與水力劈裂敏感性提高。","textEn":"Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient. Viewing reduced core stress only as beneficial unloading overlooks increased sensitivity to cracking and hydraulic fracture.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「心牆拱效應與沉降差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Core arching and differential settlement\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。","窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.","Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient."],"answer":2,"explanation":"窄谷或陡峭岸坡容易形成複雜三維拱效應，單一二維係數可能不足。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Narrow valleys and steep abutments create three-dimensional arching beyond one two-dimensional coefficient. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b235-v15-21","title":"反濾保持與排水能力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Filter retention and drainage capacity: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「反濾保持與排水能力」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Filter retention and drainage capacity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"反濾材料要保持心牆細粒又提供足夠通水性，兩條要求需同時滿足。粒徑比只是初步條件，分散性土與間斷級配需要專門試驗。 假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。 施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。只用料場平均曲線可能同時漏掉這兩種相反缺陷，不能代替鋪設連續性和界面驗證。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「反濾保持與排水能力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Filters must retain core particles while providing adequate flow capacity, requiring both conditions. Grain-size ratios are preliminary checks, while dispersive soils and gap grading require dedicated testing. Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three. A separate assumed k=10⁻⁴ m/s is not derived from that ratio or an acceptance criterion. Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage. A stockpile-average curve can miss both opposing defects and cannot replace checks of placement continuity and zone interfaces. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Filter retention and drainage capacity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three.","failure":"常見誤解：「反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「反濾保持與排水能力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Filter retention and drainage capacity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-21-k1","title":"反濾保持與排水能力","titleEn":"Filter retention and drainage capacity","text":"反濾材料要保持心牆細粒又提供足夠通水性，兩條要求需同時滿足。粒徑比只是初步條件，分散性土與間斷級配需要專門試驗。","textEn":"Filters must retain core particles while providing adequate flow capacity, requiring both conditions. Grain-size ratios are preliminary checks, while dispersive soils and gap grading require dedicated testing.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「反濾保持與排水能力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Filter retention and drainage capacity\" is correct?","options":["反濾材料要保持心牆細粒又提供足夠通水性，兩條要求需同時滿足。","反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。","排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。"],"optionsEn":["Filters must retain core particles while providing adequate flow capacity, requiring both conditions.","A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.","High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"反濾材料要保持心牆細粒又提供足夠通水性，兩條要求需同時滿足。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Filters must retain core particles while providing adequate flow capacity, requiring both conditions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b235-v15-22","title":"反濾保持與排水能力：定量估算","titleEn":"Filter retention and drainage capacity: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「反濾保持與排水能力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Filter retention and drainage capacity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three. A separate assumed k=10⁻⁴ m/s is not derived from that ratio or an acceptance criterion. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three. A separate assumed k=10⁻⁴ m/s is not derived from that ratio or an acceptance criterion.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「反濾保持與排水能力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Filter retention and drainage capacity\", which statement holds?","options":["新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3。","所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。"],"optionsEn":["All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three.","Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設基土d85=0.2 mm、反濾D15=0.6 mm，保持比3；另假設反濾k=10⁻⁴ m/s，不能由比值直接推得此k或接受標準。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume base d85=0.2 mm and filter D15=0.6 mm, giving retention ratio three. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b235-v15-23","title":"反濾保持與排水能力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Filter retention and drainage capacity: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「反濾保持與排水能力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Filter retention and drainage capacity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。用出水細料量判斷是否出現持續顆粒遷移。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination. Test retention and clogging under concentrated defect flow, preserving particle discharge, time and head-difference records. Use discharged-fines mass to determine whether particle migration continues over time. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以反濾保持與排水能力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for filter retention and drainage capacity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination. Test retention and clogging under concentrated defect flow, preserving particle discharge, time and head-difference records.","failure":"注意干擾：施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。用出水細料量判斷是否出現持續顆粒遷移。","textEn":"Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination. Test retention and clogging under concentrated defect flow, preserving particle discharge, time and head-difference records. Use discharged-fines mass to determine whether particle migration continues over time.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以反濾保持與排水能力編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for filter retention and drainage capacity, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination. Test retention and clogging under concentrated defect flow, preserving particle discharge, time and head-difference records.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「反濾保持與排水能力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Filter retention and drainage capacity\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。","按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.","Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination."],"answer":2,"explanation":"按適用土類檢查完整級配，取施工後樣品確認細料未污染；以缺陷集中滲流試驗核對保持能力和堵塞反應，保留出水顆粒量、時間和水頭差資料。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check full grading for the relevant soil class and sample placed filters for contamination. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b235-v15-24","title":"反濾保持與排水能力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Filter retention and drainage capacity: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「反濾保持與排水能力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Filter retention and drainage capacity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。只用料場平均曲線可能同時漏掉這兩種相反缺陷，不能代替鋪設連續性和界面驗證。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage. A stockpile-average curve can miss both opposing defects and cannot replace checks of placement continuity and zone interfaces. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：只用料場平均曲線可能同時漏掉這兩種相反缺陷，不能代替鋪設連續性和界面驗證。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A stockpile-average curve can miss both opposing defects and cannot replace checks of placement continuity and zone interfaces.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。只用料場平均曲線可能同時漏掉這兩種相反缺陷，不能代替鋪設連續性和界面驗證。","textEn":"Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage. A stockpile-average curve can miss both opposing defects and cannot replace checks of placement continuity and zone interfaces.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「反濾保持與排水能力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Filter retention and drainage capacity\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。"],"optionsEn":["Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"施工離析會在局部形成過粗窗口，細料污染則降低排水性。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Segregation creates locally coarse windows while fines contamination reduces drainage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b235-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「排水帶流量與水頭」與「分區方量與邊界污染」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Drain flow and hydraulic head\" and \"Zone volumes and boundary contamination\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b235-v15-25","title":"排水帶流量與水頭：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Drain flow and hydraulic head: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「排水帶流量與水頭」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Drain flow and hydraulic head” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"排水帶需把滲流導出而不累積高孔壓，其能力取決於滲透率、斷面和水力坡降。出水端堵塞或尾水升高也會改變系統，不能只看材料試驗k值。 假設排水k=0.01 m/s、通流面積2 m²、坡降0.05，Q=kiA=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s；穩定飽和達西流，未含出口損失。 高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。若把設計名義斷面當永遠有效，會高估經沉降與細料遷移後的排水能力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「排水帶流量與水頭」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A drain must transmit seepage without building high pore pressure. Capacity depends on permeability, area and gradient, while outlet blockage or tailwater changes the system beyond the material permeability value. Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05. Q=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s, for steady saturated Darcy flow without outlet loss. Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients. Treating nominal section as permanently effective overstates capacity after settlement and fines migration alter the flow paths. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Drain flow and hydraulic head” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設排水k=0.01 m/s、通流面積2 m²、坡降0.05，Q=kiA=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s；穩定飽和達西流，未含出口損失。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05.","failure":"常見誤解：「排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「排水帶流量與水頭」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Drain flow and hydraulic head”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-25-k1","title":"排水帶流量與水頭","titleEn":"Drain flow and hydraulic head","text":"排水帶需把滲流導出而不累積高孔壓，其能力取決於滲透率、斷面和水力坡降。出水端堵塞或尾水升高也會改變系統，不能只看材料試驗k值。","textEn":"A drain must transmit seepage without building high pore pressure. Capacity depends on permeability, area and gradient, while outlet blockage or tailwater changes the system beyond the material permeability value.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「排水帶流量與水頭」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Drain flow and hydraulic head\" is correct?","options":["排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。","排水帶需把滲流導出而不累積高孔壓，其能力取決於滲透率、斷面和水力坡降。","各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。"],"optionsEn":["High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition.","A drain must transmit seepage without building high pore pressure.","Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned."],"answer":1,"explanation":"排水帶需把滲流導出而不累積高孔壓，其能力取決於滲透率、斷面和水力坡降。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A drain must transmit seepage without building high pore pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b235-v15-26","title":"排水帶流量與水頭：定量估算","titleEn":"Drain flow and hydraulic head: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「排水帶流量與水頭」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Drain flow and hydraulic head” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設排水k=0.01 m/s、通流面積2 m²、坡降0.05，Q=kiA=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s；穩定飽和達西流，未含出口損失。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05. Q=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s, for steady saturated Darcy flow without outlet loss. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設排水k=0.01 m/s、通流面積2 m²、坡降0.05，Q=kiA=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s；穩定飽和達西流，未含出口損失。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05. Q=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s, for steady saturated Darcy flow without outlet loss.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「排水帶流量與水頭」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Drain flow and hydraulic head\", which statement holds?","options":["水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。","用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設排水k=0.01 m/s、通流面積2 m²、坡降0.05，Q=kiA=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s。"],"optionsEn":["At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum.","Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設排水k=0.01 m/s、通流面積2 m²、坡降0.05，Q=kiA=0.001 m³/s=1 L/s；穩定飽和達西流，未含出口損失。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume drain k=0.01 m/s, flow area 2 m² and gradient 0.05. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b235-v15-27","title":"排水帶流量與水頭：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Drain flow and hydraulic head: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「排水帶流量與水頭」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Drain flow and hydraulic head” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。將出口淹沒情境下的有效坡降重新計算。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Inspect reduced area from deformation or contamination and use several heads to test the linear Darcy assumption. Recalculate effective gradients for the scenario with a submerged drain outlet. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以排水帶流量與水頭編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for drain flow and hydraulic head, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Inspect reduced area from deformation or contamination and use several heads to test the linear Darcy assumption.","failure":"注意干擾：高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。將出口淹沒情境下的有效坡降重新計算。","textEn":"Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Inspect reduced area from deformation or contamination and use several heads to test the linear Darcy assumption. Recalculate effective gradients for the scenario with a submerged drain outlet.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以排水帶流量與水頭編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for drain flow and hydraulic head, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Inspect reduced area from deformation or contamination and use several heads to test the linear Darcy assumption.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「排水帶流量與水頭」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Drain flow and hydraulic head\"?","options":["沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress."],"answer":0,"explanation":"沿排水帶量測水頭並核對出口尾水，對照集水流量和降雨；檢查通流面積是否被壓縮或污染縮小，再以不同水頭下資料確認線性達西假設是否合理。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure heads along the drain and check outlet tailwater against collected flow and rain. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b235-v15-28","title":"排水帶流量與水頭：失效診斷","titleEn":"Drain flow and hydraulic head: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「排水帶流量與水頭」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Drain flow and hydraulic head” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。若把設計名義斷面當永遠有效，會高估經沉降與細料遷移後的排水能力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients. Treating nominal section as permanently effective overstates capacity after settlement and fines migration alter the flow paths. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若把設計名義斷面當永遠有效，會高估經沉降與細料遷移後的排水能力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Treating nominal section as permanently effective overstates capacity after settlement and fines migration alter the flow paths.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。若把設計名義斷面當永遠有效，會高估經沉降與細料遷移後的排水能力。","textEn":"Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients. Treating nominal section as permanently effective overstates capacity after settlement and fines migration alter the flow paths.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「排水帶流量與水頭」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Drain flow and hydraulic head\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。","各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients.","Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned."],"answer":1,"explanation":"高流量時粗料可能出現非達西效應，出口被淹也會降低實際坡降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Coarse drains can become non-Darcy at high flow, and submerged outlets reduce gradients. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b235-v15-29","title":"分區方量與邊界污染：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Zone volumes and boundary contamination: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「分區方量與邊界污染」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Zone volumes and boundary contamination” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"分區填築的空間邊界維持不同材料的功能，推土機越界和運輸掉料可能造成混雜。總材料量正確不能證明反濾帶厚度或心牆連續性正確。 假設一層心牆長200 m、寬6 m、厚0.25 m，方量300 m³；兩側各混入0.1 m寬帶則受影響10 m³，占3.333%。 局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「分區方量與邊界污染」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Zoned placement preserves distinct material functions through spatial boundaries. Equipment crossing and spillage mix materials, so correct total quantities do not establish filter thickness or core continuity. Assume core lift length 200 m, width 6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 300 m³. Mixed bands 0.1 m wide on both sides affect 10 m³, or 3.333 percent. A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Zone volumes and boundary contamination” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層心牆長200 m、寬6 m、厚0.25 m，方量300 m³；兩側各混入0.1 m寬帶則受影響10 m³，占3.333%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core lift length 200 m, width 6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 300 m³.","failure":"常見誤解：「各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「分區方量與邊界污染」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Zone volumes and boundary contamination”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-29-k1","title":"分區方量與邊界污染","titleEn":"Zone volumes and boundary contamination","text":"分區填築的空間邊界維持不同材料的功能，推土機越界和運輸掉料可能造成混雜。總材料量正確不能證明反濾帶厚度或心牆連續性正確。","textEn":"Zoned placement preserves distinct material functions through spatial boundaries. Equipment crossing and spillage mix materials, so correct total quantities do not establish filter thickness or core continuity.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「分區方量與邊界污染」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Zone volumes and boundary contamination\" is correct?","options":["各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。","新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。","分區填築的空間邊界維持不同材料的功能，推土機越界和運輸掉料可能造成混雜。"],"optionsEn":["Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned.","All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.","Zoned placement preserves distinct material functions through spatial boundaries."],"answer":2,"explanation":"分區填築的空間邊界維持不同材料的功能，推土機越界和運輸掉料可能造成混雜。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Zoned placement preserves distinct material functions through spatial boundaries. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b235-v15-30","title":"分區方量與邊界污染：定量估算","titleEn":"Zone volumes and boundary contamination: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「分區方量與邊界污染」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Zone volumes and boundary contamination” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層心牆長200 m、寬6 m、厚0.25 m，方量300 m³；兩側各混入0.1 m寬帶則受影響10 m³，占3.333%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core lift length 200 m, width 6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 300 m³. Mixed bands 0.1 m wide on both sides affect 10 m³, or 3.333 percent. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層心牆長200 m、寬6 m、厚0.25 m，方量300 m³；兩側各混入0.1 m寬帶則受影響10 m³，占3.333%。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core lift length 200 m, width 6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 300 m³. Mixed bands 0.1 m wide on both sides affect 10 m³, or 3.333 percent.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「分區方量與邊界污染」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Zone volumes and boundary contamination\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層心牆長200 m、寬6 m、厚0.25 m，方量300 m³。","所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。","乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core lift length 200 m, width 6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 300 m³.","Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer.","Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設一層心牆長200 m、寬6 m、厚0.25 m，方量300 m³；兩側各混入0.1 m寬帶則受影響10 m³，占3.333%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume core lift length 200 m, width 6 m and thickness 0.25 m, giving 300 m³. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b235-v15-31","title":"分區方量與邊界污染：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Zone volumes and boundary contamination: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「分區方量與邊界污染」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Zone volumes and boundary contamination” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。以界面剖面照片核對反濾帶連續厚度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only. Map crossing traffic and spillage to as-built surfaces and check continuity between successive zones. Check continuous filter thickness against photographs of the actual zone interface. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以分區方量與邊界污染編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for zone volumes and boundary contamination, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only. Map crossing traffic and spillage to as-built surfaces and check continuity between successive zones.","failure":"注意干擾：局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。以界面剖面照片核對反濾帶連續厚度。","textEn":"Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only. Map crossing traffic and spillage to as-built surfaces and check continuity between successive zones. Check continuous filter thickness against photographs of the actual zone interface.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以分區方量與邊界污染編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for zone volumes and boundary contamination, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only. Map crossing traffic and spillage to as-built surfaces and check continuity between successive zones.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「分區方量與邊界污染」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Zone volumes and boundary contamination\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。","心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only.","Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用測量線、照片與批次標記核對每層分區位置，抽查界面粒徑而非只取中間；將跨區車行和材料外溢事件映射到收方面，確認相鄰層邊界連續。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use survey lines, photographs and batch labels to verify each lift boundary and sample interfaces rather than centers only. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b235-v15-32","title":"分區方量與邊界污染：失效診斷","titleEn":"Zone volumes and boundary contamination: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「分區方量與邊界污染」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Zone volumes and boundary contamination” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「各分區材料總重量正確就能證明所有分區位置與厚度正確。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Correct total material mass proves every zone is correctly located and dimensioned.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。若只按各料區進場重量驗收，空間錯位會被總量平衡掩蓋。","textEn":"A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. Acceptance based only on incoming material mass allows spatial misplacement to hide behind a correct total balance.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「分區方量與邊界污染」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Zone volumes and boundary contamination\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。","局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.","A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core."],"answer":2,"explanation":"局部混料占比小仍可能沿整條反濾帶形成堵塞，心牆被粗粒貫穿也可增加缺陷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A small mixed fraction can clog a continuous filter strip, while coarse intrusion damages the core. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b235-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「施工孔壓與載重速率」與「快速退水與支承改變」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Construction pore pressure and loading rate\" and \"Rapid drawdown and lost support\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b235-v15-33","title":"施工孔壓與載重速率：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Construction pore pressure and loading rate: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「施工孔壓與載重速率」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"快速加高會讓低滲透心牆來不及排水，新增總應力部分轉為孔壓。施工穩定必須使用相符的排水條件，不能以長期有效應力強度直接取代短期分析。 假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。 儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「施工孔壓與載重速率」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Rapid raising can load a low-permeability core faster than it drains, converting part of added total stress into pore pressure. Construction stability requires matching drainage conditions rather than substituting long-term behavior. Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa. Effective stress increases 30 kPa by Δσ′=Δσ−Δu, not a whole-dam ru value. Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「施工孔壓與載重速率」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Construction pore pressure and loading rate”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-33-k1","title":"施工孔壓與載重速率","titleEn":"Construction pore pressure and loading rate","text":"快速加高會讓低滲透心牆來不及排水，新增總應力部分轉為孔壓。施工穩定必須使用相符的排水條件，不能以長期有效應力強度直接取代短期分析。","textEn":"Rapid raising can load a low-permeability core faster than it drains, converting part of added total stress into pore pressure. Construction stability requires matching drainage conditions rather than substituting long-term behavior.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「施工孔壓與載重速率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Construction pore pressure and loading rate\" is correct?","options":["快速加高會讓低滲透心牆來不及排水，新增總應力部分轉為孔壓。","新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。","水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。"],"optionsEn":["Rapid raising can load a low-permeability core faster than it drains, converting part of added total stress into pore pressure.","All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.","At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum."],"answer":0,"explanation":"快速加高會讓低滲透心牆來不及排水，新增總應力部分轉為孔壓。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Rapid raising can load a low-permeability core faster than it drains, converting part of added total stress into pore pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b235-v15-34","title":"施工孔壓與載重速率：定量估算","titleEn":"Construction pore pressure and loading rate: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「施工孔壓與載重速率」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa. Effective stress increases 30 kPa by Δσ′=Δσ−Δu, not a whole-dam ru value. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa. Effective stress increases 30 kPa by Δσ′=Δσ−Δu, not a whole-dam ru value.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「施工孔壓與載重速率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Construction pore pressure and loading rate\", which statement holds?","options":["用濕土總重量乘含水率差就一定得到正確補水量。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa。","只要水壓小於豎向覆土壓力，就不可能發生心牆水力劈裂。"],"optionsEn":["Wet total soil mass times the moisture difference always gives the correct water addition.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa.","Hydraulic fracture is impossible whenever water pressure is below vertical overburden stress."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設新增總應力100 kPa、量測孔壓增加70 kPa，該增量的有效應力增加30 kPa；以Δσ′=Δσ−Δu計，不等同整體ru。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume added total stress 100 kPa and measured pore-pressure increase 70 kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b235-v15-35","title":"施工孔壓與載重速率：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Construction pore pressure and loading rate: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「施工孔壓與載重速率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。比對停工後孔壓消散曲線與施工載重紀錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability. Compare post-pause pressure dissipation curves against the recorded construction loading history. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以施工孔壓與載重速率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for construction pore pressure and loading rate, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability.","failure":"注意干擾：儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。比對停工後孔壓消散曲線與施工載重紀錄。","textEn":"Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability. Compare post-pause pressure dissipation curves against the recorded construction loading history.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以施工孔壓與載重速率編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for construction pore pressure and loading rate, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Check pressure-instrument zeros and assess response time using drainage distance and material permeability.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「施工孔壓與載重速率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Construction pore pressure and loading rate\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","反濾料粒徑保持比合格就能自動推得其滲透係數。","將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A passing particle-retention ratio automatically determines the filter permeability coefficient.","Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses."],"answer":2,"explanation":"將每層填築重量、時間與孔壓歷線對齊，分辨載重上升和停工消散；核對土壓計及孔壓計零點，並以排水距離與材料滲透性檢查反應時間合理性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Align lift weight and timing with pore-pressure histories, separating loading from dissipation during pauses. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b235-v15-36","title":"施工孔壓與載重速率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Construction pore pressure and loading rate: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「施工孔壓與載重速率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Construction pore pressure and loading rate” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「新增填土重量造成的總應力一定全部立即轉成有效應力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"All total stress added by new fill immediately becomes effective stress.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。若把總應力增加全部當有效壓密，會高估即時抗剪能力。","textEn":"Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. Treating all added total stress as effective compression overstates immediate shear resistance.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「施工孔壓與載重速率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Construction pore pressure and loading rate\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。"],"optionsEn":["Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum."],"answer":0,"explanation":"儀器反應遲緩可能低估真正孔壓峰值，停工後仍在消散則說明長期狀態尚未建立。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Slow instruments can understate true pressure peaks, while continued dissipation shows long-term conditions are not established. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b235-v15-37","title":"快速退水與支承改變：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Rapid drawdown and lost support: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「快速退水與支承改變」如何影響心牆土石壩分區填築的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Rapid drawdown and lost support” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Zoned placement in earth-core rockfill dams”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"退水移除上游水體支承，但心牆與坡體孔壓可能來不及下降。外部水位低不代表內部已排水，穩定分析需使用時間相關的孔壓場。 假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。 把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。慢速表面排水不能代表深部弱層同樣迅速排水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「快速退水與支承改變」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Drawdown removes external upstream support while internal pore pressures can lag. Low reservoir level does not establish drained soil, so stability requires a time-dependent internal pressure field. Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa. Assuming pressure already fell to 40 kPa gives 140 kPa, an overestimate by factor 2.333. Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. Surface drainage does not establish equally rapid drainage in deep weak layers. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rapid drawdown and lost support” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「快速退水與支承改變」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rapid drawdown and lost support”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-37-k1","title":"快速退水與支承改變","titleEn":"Rapid drawdown and lost support","text":"退水移除上游水體支承，但心牆與坡體孔壓可能來不及下降。外部水位低不代表內部已排水，穩定分析需使用時間相關的孔壓場。","textEn":"Drawdown removes external upstream support while internal pore pressures can lag. Low reservoir level does not establish drained soil, so stability requires a time-dependent internal pressure field.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「快速退水與支承改變」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Rapid drawdown and lost support\" is correct?","options":["水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。","退水移除上游水體支承，但心牆與坡體孔壓可能來不及下降。","所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。"],"optionsEn":["At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum.","Drawdown removes external upstream support while internal pore pressures can lag.","Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer."],"answer":1,"explanation":"退水移除上游水體支承，但心牆與坡體孔壓可能來不及下降。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Drawdown removes external upstream support while internal pore pressures can lag. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b235-v15-38","title":"快速退水與支承改變：定量估算","titleEn":"Rapid drawdown and lost support: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「快速退水與支承改變」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Rapid drawdown and lost support” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa. Assuming pressure already fell to 40 kPa gives 140 kPa, an overestimate by factor 2.333. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa. Assuming pressure already fell to 40 kPa gives 140 kPa, an overestimate by factor 2.333.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「快速退水與支承改變」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Rapid drawdown and lost support\", which statement holds?","options":["乾密度達標就能直接證明土體已完全飽和且沒有大孔隙。","心牆拱效應降低壓應力，因此在所有情況下都提高安全。","教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptable dry density directly proves full saturation and absence of large voids.","Core arching lowers compression and therefore improves safety in every circumstance.","Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非地標實測值或操作設定：假設某點總正應力180 kPa、退水後孔壓仍120 kPa，有效60 kPa；若誤假設孔壓已降40 kPa，會估140 kPa，高估2.333倍。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not landmark measurements or operating settings: Assume total normal stress 180 kPa and retained pore pressure 120 kPa, giving effective stress 60 kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b235-v15-39","title":"快速退水與支承改變：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Rapid drawdown and lost support: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「快速退水與支承改變」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rapid drawdown and lost support” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。把外水支承消失與內部孔壓消散分別建模。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Reconstruct external support and internal pressure at the same instant and test drainage-rate and strength sensitivity. Model loss of external water support separately from internal pressure dissipation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以快速退水與支承改變編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。","observationEn":"Site practice: Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rapid drawdown and lost support, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Reconstruct external support and internal pressure at the same instant and test drainage-rate and strength sensitivity.","failure":"注意干擾：把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。把外水支承消失與內部孔壓消散分別建模。","textEn":"Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Reconstruct external support and internal pressure at the same instant and test drainage-rate and strength sensitivity. Model loss of external water support separately from internal pressure dissipation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以快速退水與支承改變編製可交接的證據頁，註明資料時間、單位、模型適用範圍與審查者。比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。","textEn":"Prepare a reviewable evidence sheet for rapid drawdown and lost support, recording data time, units, model applicability and reviewer. Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Reconstruct external support and internal pressure at the same instant and test drainage-rate and strength sensitivity.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「快速退水與支承改變」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Rapid drawdown and lost support\"?","options":["比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","排水料滲透係數很高就保證任何出口條件下都能充分排水。"],"optionsEn":["Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","High drain permeability guarantees sufficient drainage under every outlet condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"比較水庫退水率與坡內各深度孔壓消散，確認量測點涵蓋可能滑面；用同一時間截面重建外水支承與內部壓力，並對排水速度和土體強度做敏感度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare reservoir drawdown with pore-pressure dissipation at several depths and cover plausible slip surfaces. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b235-v15-40","title":"快速退水與支承改變：失效診斷","titleEn":"Rapid drawdown and lost support: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"prerequisiteIds":["b235-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「快速退水與支承改變」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rapid drawdown and lost support” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。慢速表面排水不能代表深部弱層同樣迅速排水。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. Surface drainage does not establish equally rapid drainage in deep weak layers. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：慢速表面排水不能代表深部弱層同樣迅速排水。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Surface drainage does not establish equally rapid drainage in deep weak layers.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水庫退到低水位時，壩內所有孔壓必定已同步降到最低。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"At low reservoir level every internal pore pressure has necessarily fallen to its minimum.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b235-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。慢速表面排水不能代表深部弱層同樣迅速排水。","textEn":"Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. Surface drainage does not establish equally rapid drainage in deep weak layers.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]},{"id":"b235-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「快速退水與支承改變」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Rapid drawdown and lost support\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。","所有填築分區都越不透水，整座土石壩就一定越安全。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic.","Making every embankment zone less permeable necessarily makes the whole dam safer."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把退水後的最低庫位配上早已消散的孔壓會形成不真實荷載組合，忽略外水支承消失又會偏樂觀。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Combining minimum reservoir level with fully dissipated pressures can create an unrealistic load case, while retaining lost external support is optimistic. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-usbr-embankment","v15s-usbr-construction","v15s-usbr-filters","b-src-water","v15s-usace-gravity"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
